Z||000005||PatrickB||10-15-2000||09:54 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rockcrawl:<BR><B>Well, I tried all of those codes, and the only one that wasn't expired is the 33% one. It has a max discount of $25. I deleted everything from my order except one item that I'm really in no hurry to get. We'll see what happens!<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Heh, I didnt mean to get you scared.  I've actually used carparts quite a few times without any problems. The only thing is you have to wait a bit. But if your in no rush than its great because they always have some kind of discount.  <BR>Its just this last time that has left me kind of sour.<P>Ive actually found out that you can use the coupons more than once so you could order that item you left out seperately with the 33% off coupon.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by PatrickB (edited 10-15-2000).]||||reg||7
